      "level": 2,
      "text": "5 Frame"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "page": 12,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The T-7 frame is aluminum with a reinforced down tube for touring loads. It carries front and rear racks."
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "type": "page_footer",
      "page": 12,
      "text": "Page 12"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
